@server = http://localhost:4004
@admin  = {{server}}/odata/v4/admin
@cert   = {{server}}/odata/v4/cert
@erik004 = a0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000004
@dan     = e0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002
@john    = e0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000005

# Run the requests in order, top to bottom, right after starting `npx cds watch`.
# The database is in memory, so restarting the server resets all the data.

### 1. Admin lists Pending records -> 200, includes 004
GET {{admin}}/EmployeeCertifications?$filter=status_code eq 'Pending'
Authorization: Basic chris:chris

### 2. Non-admin is blocked -> 403
GET {{admin}}/EmployeeCertifications
Authorization: Basic ranjan:ranjan

### 3. Reject Erik's record -> 200, status Rejected
POST {{admin}}/EmployeeCertifications({{erik004}})/AdminService.reject
Authorization: Basic chris:chris
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 4. Manager Dan lists Erik's records -> 004 is NOT in the list
GET {{cert}}/EmployeeCertifications?$filter=employee/name eq 'Erik'
Authorization: Basic dan:dan

### 5. Erik tries to edit his Rejected record -> 403
PATCH {{cert}}/EmployeeCertifications({{erik004}})
Authorization: Basic erik:erik
Content-Type: application/json

{"evidenceUrl": "https://example.com/fixed"}

### 6. Approve a Rejected record -> 400, wrong status
POST {{admin}}/EmployeeCertifications({{erik004}})/AdminService.approve
Authorization: Basic chris:chris
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 7. Revoke -> 200, status Pending
POST {{admin}}/EmployeeCertifications({{erik004}})/AdminService.revoke
Authorization: Basic chris:chris
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 8. Erik fixes his record now -> 200
PATCH {{cert}}/EmployeeCertifications({{erik004}})
Authorization: Basic erik:erik
Content-Type: application/json

{"evidenceUrl": "https://example.com/fixed"}

### 9. Approve -> 200, status Verified
POST {{admin}}/EmployeeCertifications({{erik004}})/AdminService.approve
Authorization: Basic chris:chris
Content-Type: application/json

{}

# ---- Employees app (step 9). Employees use draft: create/edit a draft, change it, save it.

### 10. Delete an employee -> 405, employees are never deleted (set active = false instead)
DELETE {{admin}}/Employees(ID={{john}},IsActiveEntity=true)
Authorization: Basic chris:chris

### 11a. New employee draft -> 201
# @name newEmployee
POST {{admin}}/Employees
Authorization: Basic chris:chris
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 11b. Give it the login "erik", which Erik already has -> 200 (drafts are not checked yet)
PATCH {{admin}}/Employees(ID={{newEmployee.response.body.ID}},IsActiveEntity=false)
Authorization: Basic chris:chris
Content-Type: application/json

{"userID": "erik", "name": "Erik Two"}

### 11c. Save it -> 400, "Login 'erik' is already used by Erik"
POST {{admin}}/Employees(ID={{newEmployee.response.body.ID}},IsActiveEntity=false)/AdminService.draftActivate
Authorization: Basic chris:chris
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 11d. Clean up: discard the draft -> 204
DELETE {{admin}}/Employees(ID={{newEmployee.response.body.ID}},IsActiveEntity=false)
Authorization: Basic chris:chris

### 12a. Edit Dan (creates a draft) -> 201
POST {{admin}}/Employees(ID={{dan}},IsActiveEntity=true)/AdminService.draftEdit
Authorization: Basic chris:chris
Content-Type: application/json

{"PreserveChanges": true}

### 12b. Make Dan his own manager -> 200 (drafts are not checked yet)
PATCH {{admin}}/Employees(ID={{dan}},IsActiveEntity=false)
Authorization: Basic chris:chris
Content-Type: application/json

{"manager_ID": "{{dan}}"}

### 12c. Save it -> 400, "An employee can't be their own manager"
POST {{admin}}/Employees(ID={{dan}},IsActiveEntity=false)/AdminService.draftActivate
Authorization: Basic chris:chris
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 12d. Clean up: discard the draft -> 204
DELETE {{admin}}/Employees(ID={{dan}},IsActiveEntity=false)
Authorization: Basic chris:chris

### 13. Erik tries to read Dan's records through the employee link -> 400
# The 'certifications' link is left out of CertService on purpose (security, step 9b)
GET {{cert}}/Employees({{dan}})?$expand=certifications
Authorization: Basic erik:erik
